# Private / commercial vertical packs live here. They must NEVER land in the
# public (BUSL-1.1) repo, so this directory ignores everything by default.
#
# This `.gitignore`, the explanatory `README.md`, and the tiny `_placeholder`
# crate are tracked. The `_placeholder` crate keeps the workspace member glob
# `crates/verticals-private/*` in the root Cargo.toml resolving to at least one
# valid Cargo.toml *everywhere* — including Dependabot's sparse update tree,
# which materializes only manifest files (no README.md), so an otherwise-empty
# dir made the glob resolve to nothing and errored `.../*/Cargo.toml`.
#
# Drop a pack crate in here (e.g. `crates/verticals-private/aivyx-acme/`) and it
# joins the workspace automatically — building against the same lockfile/target
# as the core — while staying invisible to git. It depends on the stable
# `aivyx-vertical-sdk` facade exactly like the open Kitchen example, so its path
# deps (`../../aivyx-vertical-sdk`) match the in-tree packs.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!_placeholder
!_placeholder/**
